     "en": "What are you doing with the plastic that can't be reused?"
    },
    {
     "quien": "Sara",
     "nl": "Dat scheid ik van het restafval.",
     "es": "Lo separo del resto de residuos.",
     "en": "I separate it from the rest of the waste."
    },
    {
     "quien": "Noor",
     "nl": "Breng je grote spullen naar de milieustraat?",
     "es": "¿Llevas las cosas grandes al punto limpio?",
     "en": "You take the big things to the clean spot?"
    },
    {
     "quien": "Sara",
     "nl": "Ja, daardoor wordt de afvalberg kleiner.",
     "es": "Sí, así se reduce la cantidad de residuos.",
     "en": "Yeah, that's how the amount of waste is reduced."
